	(1111, 'eb0c4dff-9b61-4ad2-8540-cae93d2d1309', 'COMMUNITY_POST', 7, 'title', '베네치아 곤돌라, 탈 가치 있나요?', '2fdd199f61c4279718d5a9f70f44bcd17c447a3ed7cbb3ebf9af0217433346ea', 'en', 'Is a Venice gondola worth riding?', 'google-cloud-translation-v2', '2026-04-24 15:25:34', '2026-04-24 15:25:34'),
	(1112, 'ccf515c3-2dcd-427f-9a73-81a19be7b2a9', 'COMMUNITY_POST', 7, 'content', '솔직히 30분에 80유로 비쌉니다. 하지만 좁은 운하를 미끄러지듯 지나가는 그 경험은 돈 주고 사는 낭만이었습니다. 일몰 전후 타는 걸 추천합니다.', 'a8e45ca30e03ece95120dbb43b9995c0d58a19a07a09a0bbfd9a1f8dedab2bc7', 'en', 'Honestly, 80 euros for 30 minutes is expensive. However, the experience of gliding through the narrow canals was a romance worth the money. I recommend taking the ride around sunset.', 'google-cloud-translation-v2', '2026-04-24 15:25:34', '2026-04-24 15:25:34'),
	(1113, 'f6ca062c-7be4-48be-97cc-fd04b616aff6', 'COMMUNITY_TAG', 0, 'tag_name', '이탈리아', '8b69efcf3a7584d0aaf58411585c712cb3457d490cd2f4020f2f0cd97e1a2fa5', 'en', 'Italy', 'google-cloud-translation-v2', '2026-04-24 15:25:34', '2026-04-24 15:25:34'),
	(1114, '319232d3-94ad-45c6-ae95-f2bb9f56afee', 'COMMUNITY_TAG', 0, 'tag_name', '피렌체', '5b000430857127a63e7958b8f49f31a8dbce17495a29c764684225ecc0207d4b', 'en', 'Florence', 'google-cloud-translation-v2', '2026-04-24 15:25:34', '2026-04-24 15:25:34'),
	(1115, '049cced1-601a-4759-b79f-c116777075e6', 'COMMUNITY_TAG', 0, 'tag_name', '두오모', 'ab318fccb42ecd7f257994219498c13879c982910a24d9c1065a8584cc18674b', 'en', 'Duomo', 'google-cloud-translation-v2', '2026-04-24 15:25:35', '2026-04-24 15:25:35'),
	(1116, 'ab656e67-262a-49c5-aaec-4d3b1f121c67', 'COMMUNITY_COMMENT', 155, 'content', '미켈란젤로 언덕 진짜 베스트 뷰포인트죠. 일몰도 예쁩니다.', '9ebb4e6aafd6ca93d7957e8c28e0a83761a57e82e3468a6f1d7d564c79e08f7e', 'en', 'Michelangelo Hill is truly the best viewpoint. The sunset is beautiful too.', 'google-cloud-translation-v2', '2026-04-24 15:25:35', '2026-04-24 15:25:35'),
	(1117, '10c4c30f-4297-4b69-b793-4f1f5deec8a3', 'COMMUNITY_COMMENT', 157, 'content', '일몰 때 가면 사람 많아서 자리 먼저 잡는 게 중요해요.', '5707dc455ee19e7dd25b3aa3ce047aac4804010ef5e93e52f82c0c467c0d2acb', 'en', 'If you go at sunset, it gets crowded, so it\'s important to secure a seat first.', 'google-cloud-translation-v2', '2026-04-24 15:25:35', '2026-04-24 15:25:35'),
	(1118, '74e62c76-5623-4d3a-b4f7-16c9fc68ef3d', 'COMMUNITY_COMMENT', 156, 'content', '새벽 5시 올라가기가 쉽지 않은데 인상 깊었나 봐요. 부럽습니다.', 'fc25f0b348f9b43e18fd4a6804fee14dfaacac2c99d0ecf89ee65c59d848cfd1', 'en', 'It’s not easy to go up at 5 AM, so it must have made a strong impression. I’m envious.', 'google-cloud-translation-v2', '2026-04-24 15:25:35', '2026-04-24 15:25:35'),
	(1119, '4e92d300-cbe8-42a8-82ff-804e194cc2e4', 'COMMUNITY_COMMENT', 158, 'content', '호텔에서 언덕까지 도보 가능했나요? 택시 필요했나요?', '2541e9edf2acb6b67417a07ea29040804ea53448d5fa2868ee4087524cb7dae2', 'en', 'Was it walkable from the hotel to the hill? Did you need a taxi?', 'google-cloud-translation-v2', '2026-04-24 15:25:35', '2026-04-24 15:25:35'),
